{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A wallet holding real credentials is only as trustworthy as the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"platform it runs on. The package enforces some of this itself: without","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/development","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", receiving credentials needs a key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"store and a credential store that both say they’re durable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore\/isDurable","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore\/isDurable","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"), and services on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"loopback addresses are refused. The rest is the app’s.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Keys-and-storage","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Keys and storage"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keep "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"’s defaults: keys in the Secure Enclave,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"persistent, and holder keys asking for Face ID, Touch ID or the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"passcode before each presentation. Add "},{"code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Info.plist."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": complete data protection, out of backups."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InMemoryCredentialStore","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is for tests."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/sweepOrphanedKeys(in:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" at launch, before any issuance,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so keys an interrupted issuance left don’t accumulate."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Make one "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" per key store and credential store, and share it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the app’s life. Two over the same stores don’t coordinate: both"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"could present the same copy of a credential, so Verifiers could link"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the presentations, or redeem the same refresh token, so the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authorization server revokes the grant."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A device restored from a backup has no holder keys: its credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"show "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/holderKeyPresent","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" as false and can’t be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presented. Delete them, and receive them again."}]}]}]},{"anchor":"The-Wallet-Provider","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"The Wallet Provider"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Issuers trust the wallet because its Wallet Provider attests it. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"production Wallet Provider should attest a wallet and its keys only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after checking App Attest evidence that it’s talking to your genuine","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app on a genuine device, and should keep its own signing key in an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"HSM. The demo wallet’s provider attests anything, and is for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"development only.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Trust","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Trust"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Configure only your ecosystem’s roots: "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/issuerRoots","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for credentials, "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/verifierRoots","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Verifiers the wallet answers, and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/registrarRoots","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only for registrars, never for Verifiers or issuers, which could then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"register themselves."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For readers, "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRoots","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRequireEKU","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requireTrustedMdocReader","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" where every reader"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"must be a known one."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Never ship with "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/development","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" set."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To pin your services’ certificates, set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/tlsPins","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": host → base64 SHA-256 digests of a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"certificate’s SubjectPublicKeyInfo. Pin a CA’s key, so a leaf renewal"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doesn’t break the app, and keep a backup pin: a wrong set locks the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wallet out of that host until an update. Pins cover the SDK’s own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"requests, which "},{"code":"NSPinnedDomains","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" doesn’t reach, not your app’s, such"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as to your Wallet Provider: pin that "},{"code":"URLSession","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" yourself."}]}]}]},{"anchor":"Privacy","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Privacy"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Request batches of copies ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/batchSize","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refresh them as they’re used up ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requestRefresh","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so presentations stay unlinkable; warn the holder when one wouldn’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/linkableHere","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Log "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/message","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", never claims or credentials."}]}]}]},{"anchor":"The-build","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"The build"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Ship the release build of ","type":"text"},{"code":"Mobile","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which the package links by default.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Refuse to run on the test build, which carries an in-process issuer and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Verifier: check ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/OID4VC\/isTestBuild","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" at launch.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"A-document-provider-extension","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"A document provider extension"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The app and its extension each update a credential’s record — marking","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a copy presented, replacing copies on refresh — with a lock that spans","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"only their own process. Refresh credentials when the app becomes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"active, not while it’s in the background, so the two don’t write the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same record at once.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"article","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/goingtoproduction"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What a wallet needs before real holders use it."}],"metadata":{"role":"article","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Going to production"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Essentials","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"],"anchor":"Essentials"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialSummary/linkableHere":{"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"linkableHere","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"linkableHere","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/credentialsummary\/linkablehere","abstract":[{"text":"Whether presenting it to the Verifier asking would hand it a copy","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"another Verifier has seen. Set only on a presentation’s candidates.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/linkableHere"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/mdocReaderRoots":{"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mdocReaderRoots","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"mdocReaderRoots","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/mdocreaderroots","abstract":[{"text":"PEM certificates: the mdoc readers recognized when one signs an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"org-iso-mdoc","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" request (","type":"text"},{"code":"MdocPresentation.Request.reader","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"). Empty:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every such request is shown by its origin.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRoots"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/issuerRoots":{"title":"issuerRoots","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/issuerroots","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/issuerRoots","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"PEM certificates: the trust anchors for issuers’ credentials. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"credential signed by a certificate that doesn’t chain to them is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"refused.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"issuerRoots","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/OID4VC/isTestBuild":{"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isTestBuild","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"isTestBuild","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/oid4vc\/istestbuild","abstract":[{"text":"Whether the linked framework is the test build, carrying an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in-process test issuer and Verifier (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-tags mobiletest"},{"text":"): an app","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"should refuse to run on it.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/OID4VC\/isTestBuild"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet":{"title":"Wallet","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A holder’s wallet: OID4VCgo’s walletflow over the app’s key store,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credential store and Wallet Provider."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Wallet","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Wallet","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialStore/isDurable":{"required":true,"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isDurable"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"isDurable","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/credentialstore\/isdurable","defaultImplementations":1,"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether records survive the app quitting. Receiving credentials"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"needs a durable store unless the configuration is for development:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it also keeps an authorization in progress while the holder is at","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the issuer’s pages. The default is false.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore\/isDurable"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/message":{"title":"message","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/message","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/message","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Detail for logs: at most 300 characters, with no personal data, no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"remote party’s own description, and no URL’s path or query."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"message","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/FileCredentialStore":{"title":"FileCredentialStore","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A credential store of files: one per credential record, in a directory","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of the app’s (Application Support, by default). Records are written","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with the given file protection — complete by default: readable only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"while the device is unlocked — and kept out of backups by default,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"since a credential is useless without its holder key, which is in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this device’s Secure Enclave and can’t be restored elsewhere.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"FileCredentialStore"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/filecredentialstore","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"FileCredentialStore"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/GettingStarted":{"title":"Getting started","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/gettingstarted","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","abstract":[{"text":"Add the package, give the wallet its keys, its storage and a Wallet","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Provider, and create it at launch.","type":"text"}],"role":"article","kind":"article"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/development":{"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"development","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"development","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/development","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Relaxes what production requires, for a wallet talking to services"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on a development machine. Never ship an app with it set. It lets"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"issuers, Authorization Servers, Verifiers and status lists be on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"loopback addresses, over http there too, and skips the production"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"checks on receiving credentials: durable stores and keys, and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"random source."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/development"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/sweepOrphanedKeys(in:)":{"title":"sweepOrphanedKeys(in:)","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/sweeporphanedkeys(in:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/sweepOrphanedKeys(in:)","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Deletes every key in "},{"code":"keyStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" that none of the wallet’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credentials is bound to — left by an issuance the app quit or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"crashed in the middle of — and returns how many. Call it at launch,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before any issuance or refresh: one in progress holds keys of its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"own."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sweepOrphanedKeys","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"in","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeychainKeyStore","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet16KeychainKeyStoreC"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore":{"title":"KeychainKeyStore","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"The wallet’s keys, in the Secure Enclave and the Keychain: P-256 keys","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whose private halves never leave the Security framework. Each key’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ID is its Keychain application tag (after ","type":"text"},{"code":"Options.tagPrefix","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its label names its purpose. Holder keys also agree keys (ECDH), for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deviceMac in person: a P-256 key in the Secure Enclave or the Keychain","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can, with nothing asked of it at creation.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"KeychainKeyStore"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"KeychainKeyStore"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialSummary/holderKeyPresent":{"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"holderKeyPresent","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"holderKeyPresent","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/credentialsummary\/holderkeypresent","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether the key store still holds the credential’s key: without it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(restored to another device, say) it can’t be presented. Set in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Wallet.credentials()"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Wallet.credential(id:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/holderKeyPresent"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration":{"title":"WalletConfiguration","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"NewWallet’s configuration."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WalletConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletProvider":{"fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletprovider","title":"WalletProvider","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WalletProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Wallet Provider’s backend, which attests the wallet and its keys"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(HAIP 1.0 §4.4.1, §4.5.1). Keys are public JWKs, as JSON; the results"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are compact JWTs. A real one attests only after checking platform"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"evidence (App Attest) that it’s talking to the genuine app."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/verifierRoots":{"title":"verifierRoots","u